{"ts":"2026-08-31T14:06:29.1996223Z","session":"db7ba632-660e-41c7-bace-799ed3f6d8a2","parent_session":"db7ba632-660e-41c7-bace-799ed3f6d8a2","delegation_id":"d-2026-08-31-055","contract_id":"m-2026-08-31-005","tool":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"B=\u003crepo\u003e; cd \"$B\"; make build-daemon 2\u003e\u00261 | tail -1; cd ~/Coding/punt-labs; .bin/verify-recipe-path.sh 2\u003e\u00261 | sed -n '/^.\\[1mverify/,$p'; echo \"SCRIPT EXIT: ${PIPESTATUS[0]}\"","description":"Rebuild and run the harness against the new verify subcommand"},"tool_input_hash":"d3f190ec32cf810fb1d95d9f18401eca88ba34888896566d1f30be7dd8e54946","tool_input_preview":"{\"command\":\"B=\\u003crepo\\u003e; cd \\\"$B\\\"; make build-daemon 2\\u003e\\u00261 | tail -1; cd ~/Coding/punt-labs; .bin/verify-recipe-path.sh 2\\u003e\\u00261 | sed -n '/^.\\\\[1mverify/,$p'; echo \\\"SCRIPT EXI..."}
{"ts":"2026-08-31T14:06:33.520341055Z","session":"db7ba632-660e-41c7-bace-799ed3f6d8a2","parent_session":"db7ba632-660e-41c7-bace-799ed3f6d8a2","agent_id":"arecipe-tooling-0eaee18fe59bc3d7","agent_type":"recipe-tooling","delegation_id":"d-2026-08-31-055","contract_id":"m-2026-08-31-005","tool":"SendMessage","tool_input":{"content":"Correction noted — no further changes needed on i…","message":"Correction noted — no further changes needed on item 1, since what I already built matches your narrowed brief exactly: no flag added, credential lookup untouched, empty-passphrase behavior unweakened, error message only names the credential + resolution order.\n\nRan `.bin/verify-recipe-path.sh` myself against `feat/recipe-tooling` (`make build-daemon` at repo root, since the harness invokes `${REPO_DIR}/beadle-daemon` directly rather than PATH):\n\n```\nverify\n  PASS  verify accepts a validly signed recipe (exit 0)\n  PASS  verify rejects a tampered recipe (exit 1)\n  PASS  verify rejects an unsigned recipe (exit 1)\n\nPassphrase-protected signing key\n  PASS  signed with a protected key via the gpg-passphrase credential\n  PASS  passphrase does not appear in command output\n\nSummary\n  22 passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped\n```\n\nAll three former SKIPs are now PASS. Everything from round 1 still passes too (init, sign, daemon.json mode 600, unsigned example recipe). Removed the built `beadle-daemon` binary from the repo root afterward (it's gitignored, but I don't leave build artifacts lying around).\n\nNothing changed in the branch since my last message — items 2 and 3 as already delivered satisfy the harness as-is. The round-2 result YAML is still staged at `.tmp/missions/results/m-2026-08-31-005-round2.yaml`, waiting on the mission advancing past round 1 so I can submit it.","recipient":"team-lead","summary":"Ran your harness against my branch — 22 passed, 0 skipped","to":"team-lead","type":"message"},"tool_input_hash":"3a8bbcf70674433e2f9ad8f46d3069d33b930851953754ea12d6ba588010447e","tool_input_preview":"{\"content\":\"Correction noted — no further changes needed on i…\",\"message\":\"Correction noted — no further changes needed on item 1, since what I already built matches your narrowed brief exactly:..."}
{"ts":"2026-08-31T14:06:47.54351143Z","session":"db7ba632-660e-41c7-bace-799ed3f6d8a2","parent_session":"db7ba632-660e-41c7-bace-799ed3f6d8a2","agent_id":"areview-script-b1f0d2e3686fe8d3","agent_type":"review-script","delegation_id":"d-2026-08-31-055","contract_id":"m-2026-08-31-005","tool":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"~/Coding/punt-labs/.bin/git-pull-all.sh"},"tool_input_hash":"30fe90a4438afda10f61c0826d3bd3dec021f0783315c4496b1ddc4871a72b23","tool_input_preview":"{\"file_path\":\"~/Coding/punt-labs/.bin/git-pull-all.sh\"}"}
{"ts":"2026-08-31T14:06:54.351340368Z","session":"db7ba632-660e-41c7-bace-799ed3f6d8a2","parent_session":"db7ba632-660e-41c7-bace-799ed3f6d8a2","delegation_id":"d-2026-08-31-055","contract_id":"m-2026-08-31-005","tool":"SendMessage","tool_input":{"content":"Our messages crossed. **The mission is advanced —…","message":"Our messages crossed. **The mission is advanced — `m-2026-08-31-005` is at round 2 now.** Submit your staged result.\n\nThe blockage was mine: I verified round 1 and never filed the reflection, which is what gates the advance. Recorded in the reflection along with my error on item 1, so the audit trail carries both.\n\nI ran the harness independently against your branch and got the same result — 22 passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped. Good confirmation that we are looking at the same thing rather than my having tested a stale build.\n\nTwo things worth noting about your report, both to your credit:\n\nYou ran the harness yourself against your own branch rather than waiting for me to. That is the right instinct — it is the check that would catch a divergence between what you built and what the operator-facing path actually does, and it is cheaper for you to run it than for me to discover a gap afterward.\n\nYou removed the `beadle-daemon` build artifact from the repo root afterward even though it is gitignored. I rebuilt it for my own run, so I will clean it up on my side.\n\nNothing further on the code. Submit the result and I will close the mission, then take the branch through review and a PR.","recipient":"recipe-tooling","summary":"Mission advanced — submit round 2 now","to":"recipe-tooling","type":"message"},"tool_input_hash":"af4f0a27f64a38c439f975471895fd943dfb3d264fc08456109a317ab0ecf42a","tool_input_preview":"{\"content\":\"Our messages crossed. **The mission is advanced —…\",\"message\":\"Our messages crossed. **The mission is advanced — `m-2026-08-31-005` is at round 2 now.** Submit your staged result.\\n\\..."}
{"ts":"2026-08-31T14:06:59.11100692Z","session":"db7ba632-660e-41c7-bace-799ed3f6d8a2","parent_session":"db7ba632-660e-41c7-bace-799ed3f6d8a2","delegation_id":"d-2026-08-31-055","contract_id":"m-2026-08-31-005","tool":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"B=\u003crepo\u003e; cd \"$B\"; rm -f beadle-daemon; echo \"=== branch state ===\"; git log --oneline main..HEAD | head -10; echo \"--- working tree ---\"; git status --short | grep -v \"^??\" | head -4; echo \"=== diff stat vs main ===\"; git diff --stat main..HEAD | tail -3","description":"Clean artifact and review branch state"},"tool_input_hash":"a8b5dcf29cc1361a68cbfa6310ea2126afb562b655dd265631abf87abe72231f","tool_input_preview":"{\"command\":\"B=\\u003crepo\\u003e; cd \\\"$B\\\"; rm -f beadle-daemon; echo \\\"=== branch state ===\\\"; git log --oneline main..HEAD | head -10; echo \\\"--- working tree ---\\\"; git status --short | grep -v \\\"^?..."}
