{"ts":"2026-08-31T14:07:30.608209237Z","session":"db7ba632-660e-41c7-bace-799ed3f6d8a2","parent_session":"db7ba632-660e-41c7-bace-799ed3f6d8a2","agent_id":"arecipe-tooling-0eaee18fe59bc3d7","agent_type":"recipe-tooling","delegation_id":"d-2026-08-31-055","contract_id":"m-2026-08-31-005","tool":"SendMessage","tool_input":{"content":"Can't submit yet — `ethos mission result` hard-re…","message":"Can't submit yet — `ethos mission result` hard-rejects on contract validation (independent of --verify):\n\n```\nethos: mission result: result files_changed contains 3 path(s) outside\nmission \"m-2026-08-31-005\" write_set: Makefile, cmd/beadle-daemon/verify_cmd.go,\ncmd/beadle-daemon/verify_cmd_test.go\n```\n\n`ethos mission show` confirms the contract's write_set still only has the original 14 round-1 paths — the Makefile amendment you stated in chat didn't make it into the actual contract, and verify_cmd.go/verify_cmd_test.go were never added either. I don't have a CLI command to widen a write_set myself (checked `ethos mission --help`'s subcommand list — no update/amend/edit; `correct` only applies to a closed mission). The tool's own built-in guidance for this exact situation is to submit `verdict: escalate, files_changed: []` with the gap in `open_questions`, but since you've already reviewed and ratified all three files in chat and want a pass result, I'm asking directly instead of escalating past you.\n\nCould you widen the write_set to include `Makefile`, `cmd/beadle-daemon/verify_cmd.go`, and `cmd/beadle-daemon/verify_cmd_test.go` (whatever mechanism you have for that), then let me know? I'll submit the staged round-2 result immediately once it's in.","recipient":"team-lead","summary":"Result submission blocked — write_set doesn't include verify files or Makefile","to":"team-lead","type":"message"},"tool_input_hash":"a703f944ef352c3966be23b6ec92d2f885ab4cbf02d3929fa82abe5b426f5592","tool_input_preview":"{\"content\":\"Can't submit yet — `ethos mission result` hard-re…\",\"message\":\"Can't submit yet — `ethos mission result` hard-rejects on contract validation (independent of --verify):\\n\\n```\\nethos:..."}
{"ts":"2026-08-31T14:07:42.110251265Z","session":"db7ba632-660e-41c7-bace-799ed3f6d8a2","parent_session":"db7ba632-660e-41c7-bace-799ed3f6d8a2","delegation_id":"d-2026-08-31-055","contract_id":"m-2026-08-31-005","tool":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"B=\u003crepo\u003e; cd \"$B\"; ethos mission --help 2\u003e\u00261 | sed -n '/Available Commands/,/Flags/p'; echo \"=== any amend/write-set flag? ===\"; ethos mission --help 2\u003e\u00261 | grep -iE \"write.set|amend|update|edit\" | head -5 || echo \"  none in top-level help\"","description":"Check ethos for a write-set amendment mechanism"},"tool_input_hash":"2787b77a1006171f9906b63be372bb5fdd2d46eaff14f52af79181fc48c98bb3","tool_input_preview":"{\"command\":\"B=\\u003crepo\\u003e; cd \\\"$B\\\"; ethos mission --help 2\\u003e\\u00261 | sed -n '/Available Commands/,/Flags/p'; echo \\\"=== any amend/write-set flag? ===\\\"; ethos mission --help 2\\u003e\\u00261..."}
