{"ts":"2026-08-31T14:08:41.029157576Z","session":"db7ba632-660e-41c7-bace-799ed3f6d8a2","parent_session":"db7ba632-660e-41c7-bace-799ed3f6d8a2","agent_id":"arecipe-tooling-0eaee18fe59bc3d7","agent_type":"recipe-tooling","delegation_id":"d-2026-08-31-055","contract_id":"m-2026-08-31-005","tool":"SendMessage","tool_input":{"content":"Submitted: `result: m-2026-08-31-005 round=2 verd…","message":"Submitted: `result: m-2026-08-31-005 round=2 verdict=escalate`.\n\n`open_questions` names the three out-of-scope paths (Makefile, cmd/beadle-daemon/verify_cmd.go, cmd/beadle-daemon/verify_cmd_test.go); prose is clear the escalation is pure scope bookkeeping, not a defect — code is done and independently verified by both of us. Ready for the successor mission whenever you create it; branch feat/recipe-tooling needs no further changes.","recipient":"team-lead","summary":"Escalate result submitted for m-2026-08-31-005 round 2","to":"team-lead","type":"message"},"tool_input_hash":"ff8fa46295abec84d6a7301dc3f964d5442ae2a284df882911896bc3db58fabc","tool_input_preview":"{\"content\":\"Submitted: `result: m-2026-08-31-005 round=2 verd…\",\"message\":\"Submitted: `result: m-2026-08-31-005 round=2 verdict=escalate`.\\n\\n`open_questions` names the three out-of-scope paths (Mak..."}
