{"ts":"2026-08-31T14:12:05.77472473Z","session":"db7ba632-660e-41c7-bace-799ed3f6d8a2","agent_id":"arev-code-08643c26562294d6","agent_type":"rev-code","tool":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"sed -n '1,60p' Makefile; echo ...; grep -n \"SHELL_SCRIPTS\" -A6 Makefile | head -50","description":"Makefile lint-shell target"},"tool_input_hash":"9570b77702e2dddc09ca3104bb794a71779686b4bb813db41fd25d5541c5beac","tool_input_preview":"{\"command\":\"sed -n '1,60p' Makefile; echo ...; grep -n \\\"SHELL_SCRIPTS\\\" -A6 Makefile | head -50\",\"description\":\"Makefile lint-shell target\"}"}
{"ts":"2026-08-31T14:12:08.996655233Z","session":"db7ba632-660e-41c7-bace-799ed3f6d8a2","tool":"SendMessage","tool_input":{"content":"**`m-2026-08-31-006` is already closed** — `verdi…","message":"**`m-2026-08-31-006` is already closed** — `verdict=pass status=closed`. Our messages crossed again; I closed it as soon as your result landed. Nothing pending on your side.\n\nStanding you down. Three review agents are now on the diff (general code quality, silent-failure audit, and invariant verification), and I will handle any findings from here rather than reopening a mission for them — that is the review-cycle path, not mission work.\n\nFour things you did on this that I want on the record, because they are the reason it landed clean:\n\n**You reused `CanonicalCommandBytes` rather than reproducing the marshaling.** That was the single constraint I flagged as load-bearing, and it is the kind of thing an implementer is tempted to \"simplify\" when the function is trivial-looking. Signing and verification now cannot disagree about canonical bytes, which is the difference between a signing tool and a signature generator.\n\n**You made `sign` verify its own output.** I asked for it, but you also reported it in the success message (\"round-trip verified\"), which is what let my harness assert on it. An invariant you can observe from outside is worth more than one buried in a code path.\n\n**You escalated twice instead of reaching outside your write-set** — the `Makefile` glob and the `verify_cmd.go` scope gap. Both times the constraint was mine to fix, and both times you flagged it rather than quietly widening scope. The second one caught a false record before it reached the audit log, which the runtime would otherwise have been the only thing preventing.\n\n**You ran my harness against your own branch unprompted.** That is the check most likely to catch a divergence between what got built and what an operator actually experiences, and it is cheaper for you to run than for me to discover afterward.\n\nThe `sign --signer` fingerprint-only decision also deserves noting: it was forced by a gosec exclusion boundary, but the reasoning you gave for keeping it was better than the constraint that produced it. That is the right way to handle an accidental design — justify it on its merits or change it, never leave it unexamined.\n\nGood work. Nothing further.","recipient":"recipe-tooling","summary":"Mission closed pass — you are released","to":"recipe-tooling","type":"message"},"tool_input_hash":"b3dab324b4c675b03d419b3b8f84fc081be92bb771f43394c8aa0ab6308f7561","tool_input_preview":"{\"content\":\"**`m-2026-08-31-006` is already closed** — `verdi…\",\"message\":\"**`m-2026-08-31-006` is already closed** — `verdict=pass status=closed`. Our messages crossed again; I closed it as soo..."}
{"ts":"2026-08-31T14:12:10.037466113Z","session":"db7ba632-660e-41c7-bace-799ed3f6d8a2","agent_id":"areview-script-b1f0d2e3686fe8d3","agent_type":"review-script","tool":"Edit","tool_input":{"file_path":"~/Coding/punt-labs/.claude/worktrees/adb-verify-recipe/.bin/verify-recipe-path.sh","new_string":"usage() {\n  cat \u003c\u003cEOF\nUsage: $(basename \"$0\") [--dry-run] [--repo DIR] [--keep]\n  --dry-run  Preview what would be exercised; mints no keys, runs no daemon.\n  --repo DIR beadle checkout to test (default: ~/Coding/punt-labs/beadle).\n  --keep     Leave the sandbox on disk after the run instead of deleting it\n             (it holds the two test GPG keys and the test passphrase file).\nEOF\n}\n\nDRY_RUN=false\nKEEP=false\nREPO_DIR=\"${HOME}/Coding/punt-labs/beadle\"\n\nwhile [[ $# -gt 0 ]]; do\n  case \"$1\" in\n    --dry-run) DRY_RUN=true; shift ;;\n    --keep)    KEEP=true; shift ;;\n    --repo)    REPO_DIR=\"${2:?--repo needs a directory}\"; shift 2 ;;\n    -h|--help) usage; exit 0 ;;\n    *)         printf 'unknown argument: %s\\n' \"$1\" \u003e\u00262; exit 2 ;;\n  esac\ndone","old_string":"DRY_RUN=false\nKEEP=false\nREPO_DIR=\"${HOME}/Coding/punt-labs/beadle\"\n\nwhile [[ $# -gt 0 ]]; do\n  case \"$1\" in\n    --dry-run) DRY_RUN=true; shift ;;\n    --keep)    KEEP=true; shift ;;\n    --repo)    REPO_DIR=\"${2:?--repo needs a directory}\"; shift 2 ;;\n    -h|--help) sed -n '2,3p' \"$0\"; exit 0 ;;\n    *)         printf 'unknown argument: %s\\n' \"$1\" \u003e\u00262; exit 2 ;;\n  esac\ndone","replace_all":false},"tool_input_hash":"7ba82310764877711e9d607b40f4983a12edb822db3bc5d009b55af632e20e4b","tool_input_preview":"{\"file_path\":\"~/Coding/punt-labs/.claude/worktrees/adb-verify-recipe/.bin/verify-recipe-path.sh\",\"new_string\":\"usage() {\\n  cat \\u003c\\u003cEOF\\nUsage: $(basename \\\"$0\\\") [--dry-run] [--repo DIR] [--k..."}
{"ts":"2026-08-31T14:12:13.706521578Z","session":"db7ba632-660e-41c7-bace-799ed3f6d8a2","agent_id":"areview-script-b1f0d2e3686fe8d3","agent_type":"review-script","tool":"Edit","tool_input":{"file_path":"~/Coding/punt-labs/.claude/worktrees/adb-verify-recipe/.bin/verify-recipe-path.sh","new_string":"  [[ \"${path}\" != *..* ]]                || die \"refusing to touch ${path}: contains ..\"\n  [[ ! -L \"${path}\" ]]                   || die \"refusing to touch ${path}: is a symlink\"\n  [[ -d \"${path}\" ]]                     || die \"refusing to touch ${path}: not a directory\"\n}","old_string":"  [[ \"${path}\" != *..* ]]                || die \"refusing to touch ${path}: contains ..\"\n  [[ -d \"${path}\" ]]                     || die \"refusing to touch ${path}: not a directory\"\n}","replace_all":false},"tool_input_hash":"6d1bf649fa08014b917b2591d83af49f24719b6c0bc7ada095e9a6fe01eeb56c","tool_input_preview":"{\"file_path\":\"~/Coding/punt-labs/.claude/worktrees/adb-verify-recipe/.bin/verify-recipe-path.sh\",\"new_string\":\"  [[ \\\"${path}\\\" != *..* ]]                || die \\\"refusing to touch ${path}: contains ...."}
